# GitHub has no CAIRN grammar; Rust has the closest keywords and punctuation (fn, let mut, struct, enum, match, ->, =>).
# Highlighted as Rust, but not counted as Rust in the repository's language bar.
*.cairn linguist-language=Rust linguist-detectable=false

# Written by generators; `make docs` and `make editors` rewrite them.
docs/std_api.md linguist-generated
editors/vscode/syntaxes/cairn.tmLanguage.json linguist-generated
editors/vim/** linguist-generated
